Choose a license before making any commit. This is enforced by the
project's CLAUDE.md rules.

From the repository root, run:
  ./new-project.py <name> --license MIT
  ./new-project.py <name> --license Apache-2.0
  ./new-project.py <name> --license GPL-3.0-only
  ./new-project.py <name> --license LGPL-3.0-only
  ./new-project.py <name> --license BSD-2-Clause
  ./new-project.py <name> --license BSD-3-Clause

Or create this file manually with the full license text.
See infrastructure/docs/design.md "Licensing" section for guidance.
